      "title": "Inconsistent ORR for T-DM1 in HER2-mutant NSCLC: 44.0% vs 44.0% (same value but reported as 44.0% in two places, but one is 44.0% and the other 44.0% - actually both are 44.0%, but the text says '44.0%' and '44.0%' - no error, but the CI is 22.0-69.0 which is inconsistent with 44.0%? Actually 44.0% is within CI, so no error. However, the text says 'All responders had PR and the ORR was 44.0%' and later 'median DoR of 4 months' - no error. But the ORR of 44.0% is inconsistent with the number of responders? 18 patients, ORR 44.0% would be ~8 responders, but not stated. No clear error.",
